  "description": "The pdfpecker command-line tool: HTML and Markdown to PDF (with wkhtmltopdf-compatible options and a watch mode), merge, split, rotate, compact, sign, verify and encrypt PDFs, and PDF to image, HTML and text. Needs no browser; on a .NET 10 or 11 SDK it installs as a Native AOT executable that starts in milliseconds.",
